Dialogue: 0,00:00:00.30,00:00:03.06,Guide,,0,0,0,,Let’s look under the hood.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:03.06,00:00:09.70,Guide,,0,0,0,,Before changing code, identify the main components and who owns each responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:10.30,00:00:15.52,Guide,,0,0,0,,This Nx monorepo contains two applications, shared libraries, and tools.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:15.52,00:00:19.70,Guide,,0,0,0,,Separate application logic, shared presentation, and source analysis.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:20.30,00:00:27.20,Guide,,0,0,0,,Invoicing manages invoices, with its own entry point, routes, list, and detail pages.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:27.60,00:00:32.33,Guide,,0,0,0,,Procurement manages purchase orders through its own entry and routes.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:32.33,00:00:34.70,Guide,,0,0,0,,Both applications use shared libraries.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:35.30,00:00:37.75,Guide,,0,0,0,,This is the real Invoicing App.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:37.75,00:00:44.70,Guide,,0,0,0,,The router selects pages; App owns invoice state and passes it to the pages that need it.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:45.30,00:00:50.52,Guide,,0,0,0,,The Design System supplies the shell, fields, tables, and dialogs.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:50.52,00:00:54.70,Guide,,0,0,0,,One shared component can therefore affect both applications.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:55.30,00:01:00.74,GuideLeft,,0,0,0,,Shared contains business types, fixtures, totals, money formatting, and local storage.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:00.74,00:01:04.70,GuideLeft,,0,0,0,,It also exports the locale and translation interface.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:05.30,00:01:08.98,Guide,,0,0,0,,Locale, document direction, styling, and icon meaning are separate.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:08.98,00:01:14.70,Guide,,0,0,0,,Study uses document RTL and MUI LTR; icons require semantic review, not automatic mirroring.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:15.30,00:01:18.72,Guide,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,760)}The Scanner collects static evidence and potential risks.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:18.72,00:01:24.70,Guide,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,760)}The Codemod constrains changes through safety checks; a finding is not automatic repair approval.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:25.30,00:01:29.23,Guide,,0,0,0,,These relationships come from actual imports.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:29.23,00:01:33.81,Guide,,0,0,0,,Both applications use Design System and Shared.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:33.81,00:01:39.70,Guide,,0,0,0,,Tools analyze source files; neither application imports the other.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:40.30,00:01:49.07,Guide,,0,0,0,,Our real example is invoice1048: Northstar Studio, four thousand eight hundred US dollars, Pending.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:49.07,00:01:54.70,Guide,,0,0,0,,The actual table link opens the same invoice details.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:55.30,00:02:02.56,Guide,,0,0,0,,A symptom may appear in an application while its owner is a shared component or runtime layer.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:02.56,00:02:04.70,Guide,,0,0,0,,Establish causality before changing code.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:05.30,00:02:09.70,Guide,,0,0,0,,How do we find RTL risks across this codebase?
